      "content": "theraphy doesn't really change who u are at the core though. i just feel like i'm a mistake. like, if i actually \"break the cycle\" it's just gonna be more struggle and more pain for me and everyone else who has to watch me fail. maybe the cycle only stops if the person carrying it just... isn't there anymore.",
