      "content": "i know there are help lines and stuff but it feels so hollow. it doesn't change the fact that i feel like a poison to the people i love. if i stay, i just keep dragging everyone down with my mess. if i wasn't here, at least the struggle stops with me. it feels almost like the only selfless thing left to do is just stop being a burden.",
